d test)","kind":"puff"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv1.mp3","label":"今天 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v2","en":"not","note":"negates 有 and past actions (還沒 = not yet)","cells":[{"ch":"沒","py":"méi","t":2,"s":"没","fc":[["ei","ten-E: ei like ‘vein’"]]}],"cues":[{"chip":"ei","lab":"méi","cue":"ei like ‘vein’"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv2.mp3","label":"沒 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v3","en":"not have","note":"rise, then a full dip if phrase-final","cells":[{"ch":"沒","py":"méi","t":2,"s":"没"},{"ch":"有","py":"yǒu","t":3}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv3.mp3","label":"沒有 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v4","en":"yet, still; pretty, rather","note":"還OK = pretty OK; 還沒 = not yet","cells":[{"ch":"還","py":"hái","t":2,"s":"还","mk":["h","~","#E67700"]}],"cues":[{"sym":"~","col":"#E67700","lab":"h","cue":"light scratch at the back","kind":"h"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv4.mp3","label":"還 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v5","en":"to wait","note":"half-third mid-phrase, full dip at the end (我還在等)","cells":[{"ch":"等","py":"děng","t":3,"mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"],"fc":[["-ng","-ng: back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"],["e = uh","short-E: en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"]]}],"cues":[{"sym":"°","col":"#E67700","lab":"d","cue":"no puff, no voice: sPin","kind":"nopuff"},{"chip":"-ng","lab":"děng","cue":"back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"},{"chip":"e = uh","lab":"děng","cue":"en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv5.mp3","label":"等 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v6","en":"\"one sec\", a moment, a bit","note":"一 rises before a 4th: yí xià","cells":[{"ch":"一","py":"yī","t":1,"mk":["yi","↗","#17A398"],"said":"yí"},{"ch":"下","py":"xià","t":4,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"yī xià","cue":"yī → yí before a 4th","kind":"yi"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv6.mp3","label":"一下 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v7","en":"[still ongoing]","note":"z = Position 3, no puff","cells":[{"ch":"還","py":"hái","t":2,"s":"还"},{"ch":"在","py":"zài","t":4,"mk":["p3","3","#C92A2A"]}],"cues":[{"sym":"3","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"z","cue":"Position 3: tip on top teeth","kind":"p3"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv7.mp3","label":"還在 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v8","en":"to come","note":"l + rise; 來了 lái le","cells":[{"ch":"來","py":"lái","t":2,"s":"来"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv8.mp3","label":"來 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v9","en":"beautiful","note":"p puff; 亮 often light, Taiwan speakers may keep a full 4th","cells":[{"ch":"漂","py":"piào","t":4,"mk":["puff","ʰ","#E67700"]},{"ch":"亮","py":"liang","t":5}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv9.mp3","label":"漂亮 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v10","en":"a shop, a store","note":"d = no puff; -ian sounds like 'yen'","cells":[{"ch":"店","py":"diàn","t":4}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv10.mp3","label":"店 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v11","en":"one [of something]","note":"一 rises before 個 (underlyingly 4th): yí ge","cells":[{"ch":"一","py":"yī","t":1,"mk":["yi","↗","#17A398"],"said":"yí"},{"ch":"個","py":"gè","t":4,"s":"个","mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"yī gè","cue":"yī → yí before a 4th","kind":"yi"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv11.mp3","label":"一個 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v12","en":"to want; important; to ask for; will, going to; may, must; probably; if","note":"我也要 = I want (one) too","cells":[{"ch":"要","py":"yào","t":4}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv12.mp3","label":"要 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]}]},{"type":"cards","title":"Listening notes","items":[["還沒 and 還在: two kinds of 'still'.","還沒 hái méi (2+2, two rises in a row, the second slightly lower) means 'not yet'; 還在 hái zài (2+4, rise then a big fall) means 'still in the middle of it'. 還OK uses the softer 'pretty, rather' sense."],["一 changes tone by what follows.","一下 and 一個 are listed as yī, but before a 4th (下, and 個 even when it goes light) 一 surfaces as a rise: yí xià, yí ge. In 等一下 the 等 is a half-third, so you get low creak, rise, fall."],["3+3 rises: 我也要, 你在哪裡啊.","我也要 is wó yě yào: 我 rises because 也 is a 3rd, then 也 stays low before the 4th 要. 哪裡 nǎ lǐ also comes out ná li, with 裡 light."],["啊 bends to what's before it.","After the -i glide in 對 (duì) and 裡 (li), 啊 is heard as ya (對呀, 哪裡呀); the transcriber literally wrote 呀. After a vowel like 還OK it stays a."],["Half-thirds before non-thirds.","你今天, 好喝, 我還, 你在, 等咖啡: each 3rd stays a low creak [21] and the next syllable launches from the floor. Only phrase-final 等 (我還在等) gets the full dip [214]."],["Puffs and plateaus.","咖啡 kā fēi and 今天 jīn tiān are 55-55 plateaus. k and p (咖, 漂, 看) are aspirated; d (等, 店, 東) is not, so 等 vs a hypothetical teng is the Position 1 contrast you've practised."]]}],"schema":1,"date":"2026-11-04T08:00-05:00"}